    "detailed_description": "Zero Vortex is an all-new retro six-degrees-of-freedom shooter experience!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/b5a20b6ca8f92833e487873db6404545.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate interconnected rooms that shuffle randomly<br></li><li>Explore multiple levels split into three episodes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/fa3d351b51d64caf698d65fb7698491e.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your weapons with multiple different upgrade tree's<br></li><li>Find powerups like an afterburner or a cloaking device<br></li><li>Beware of environmental hazards such as lava and corrosive gas</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/c38522dc3f82559e9d91becdf9448060.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clarity: All enemies look different at a glance<br></li><li>Retro: pixelated textures and low-poly 3D models<br></li><li>Bespoke soundtrack using General MIDI, inspired by 90s games</li></ul><br>Dive into a world of mind-bending levels and intense battles.",
    "about_the_game": "Zero Vortex is an all-new retro six-degrees-of-freedom shooter experience!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/b5a20b6ca8f92833e487873db6404545.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate interconnected rooms that shuffle randomly<br></li><li>Explore multiple levels split into three episodes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/fa3d351b51d64caf698d65fb7698491e.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your weapons with multiple different upgrade tree's<br></li><li>Find powerups like an afterburner or a cloaking device<br></li><li>Beware of environmental hazards such as lava and corrosive gas</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342730/extras/c38522dc3f82559e9d91becdf9448060.avif?t=1743335018\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clarity: All enemies look different at a glance<br></li><li>Retro: pixelated textures and low-poly 3D models<br></li><li>Bespoke soundtrack using General MIDI, inspired by 90s games</li></ul><br>Dive into a world of mind-bending levels and intense battles.",
    "short_description": "Get lost in the mind-bending world of Zero Vortex, a retro 6DOF shooter. Navigate disorienting levels, upgrade weapons, and face off against diverse enemies. Immerse yourself in mixed modern-retro graphics and an all-new soundtrack. Prepare for chaos!",
